OL,3,GNEWSANHS launches 24/7 mental health
OL,4,Atext service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS has launched a new text service
OL,7,Fdesigned to provide round-the-clock
OL,8,Fmental health support across the East
OL,9,Fof England.
OL,11,FStaffed by registered health and care
OL,12,Fprofessionals, it is available 24/7 for
OL,13,Fpeople of all ages.
OL,15,FThe service can be used by people
OL,16,Fliving in Bedfordshire, Cambridgeshire,
OL,17,FEssex, Hertfordshire, Norfolk, Suffolk
OL,18,Fand Milton Keynes.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
